Nit: we should probably also validate non-numeric `teamId` at the handler level to return a 400 instead of 500 in the downstream integer parsing 
```suggestion
       for _, v := range teamIds {
               if _, err := strconv.ParseInt(v, 10, 64); err != nil {
                       http.Error(w, fmt.Sprintf("invalid teamId value %q: must be an integer", v), http.StatusBadRequest)
                       return
               }
       }
```

